{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo plunges you into the world of Pluralys. You play Elie, a 16-year-old who lives a peaceful life filled with friends, family and passion. In short, a nice life! In this seemingly ordinary world, Elie receives a strange message that may change everything....\u00a0 something mysterious is happening, but no dungeons and no dragons are involved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>During this demo, you'll discover :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jeff, Sector G-4 - the first main area of the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version of the game, Jeff is way more serious...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The village of Sector G-7</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this lively neighbourhood and meet its inhabitants.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fascinating and surprising cast of characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your two best friends, Gab and Medie, for the first time, and interact with a host of other memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_friendship__1_.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A mysterious object</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It gives you a strange power... It's up to you to find out how to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_capabilities__1_.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meaningful choices to explore</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to the people of Pluralys: you'll be surprised by the richness of the dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be curious, observe carefully and explore every nook and cranny of Sector G!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_choice.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A taste of the full adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a taste of the first few hours of the full adventure, allowing you to discover the world, the game mechanics and the narrative tone of Pluralys. You play the main quest and have access to many of the secondary quests (not all, of course).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't hesitate to visit the main Steam page of the game to find out more. Please add us to your wishlist, it will help the project and you'll stay informed about what's to come in this nice little game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722750?t=1747276169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/c1b273713d76a79768fccca68c615e68bb35bcb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747276169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/e5582768c8fbc834af66955f5ba2ca1c6180415c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747276169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/e5582768c8fbc834af66955f5ba2ca1c6180415c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747276169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo plunges you into the world of Pluralys. You play Elie, a 16-year-old who lives a peaceful life filled with friends, family and passion. In short, a nice life! In this seemingly ordinary world, Elie receives a strange message that may change everything....\u00a0 something mysterious is happening, but no dungeons and no dragons are involved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>During this demo, you'll discover :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jeff, Sector G-4 - the first main area of the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version of the game, Jeff is way more serious...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The village of Sector G-7</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this lively neighbourhood and meet its inhabitants.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fascinating and surprising cast of characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your two best friends, Gab and Medie, for the first time, and interact with a host of other memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_friendship__1_.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A mysterious object</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It gives you a strange power... It's up to you to find out how to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_capabilities__1_.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meaningful choices to explore</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to the people of Pluralys: you'll be surprised by the richness of the dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be curious, observe carefully and explore every nook and cranny of Sector G!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/extras/GIF_Steam_EN_choice.gif?t=1747276169\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A taste of the full adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a taste of the first few hours of the full adventure, allowing you to discover the world, the game mechanics and the narrative tone of Pluralys. You play the main quest and have access to many of the secondary quests (not all, of course).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't hesitate to visit the main Steam page of the game to find out more. Please add us to your wishlist, it will help the project and you'll stay informed about what's to come in this nice little game!</p>","developers":["Ivalys Studios "],"fullgame":{"appid":"3275440","name":"Pluralys"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/078c0a13243cdce7ef0d374c95cda04db921fc0e/header.jpg?t=1747276169","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</