amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/99cea9c83daefeec010958ba802cee3149e7ff1c/ss_99cea9c83daefeec010958ba802cee3149e7ff1c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747276169","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722750/99cea9c83daefeec010958ba802cee3149e7ff1c/ss_99cea9c83daefeec010958ba802cee3149e7ff1c.600x338.jpg?t=1747276169"}],"short_description":"Welcome to the demo of Pluralys: a fun indie RPG full of adventures. You play Elie, a young person living a peaceful life\u2014until unexpected visitors arrive and change everything. What seems like a quiet, cozy story hides deeper mysteries to uncover and secret plots waiting to be exposed","steam_appid":3722750,"support_info":{"email":"pluralys@studiosivalys.ca","url":"https://www.pluralys.ca/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Ukrainian, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America","type":"demo","website":"https://www.pluralys.ca/"}